  "remarks": "Pavel Chernyshov is the director and founder of the Simbirsk Design Bureau “Piranya” (SDB “Piranya”) a Russia-based company that manufactures drones used by Russia in its war of aggression against Ukraine. SDB “Piranya” manufactures First Person View (FPV) drones and specifically the models “Piranya-7”, “Piranya-10” and “Piranya-13”. The company manufactures up to 10 000 drones monthly and the Russian Army views its products as being extremely valuable in its military operations.",
